{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"160","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Unlucky Ticket"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of you probably has your personal experience of riding public transportation and buying tickets. After a person buys a ticket (which traditionally has an "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"even"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of digits), he usually checks whether the ticket is lucky. Let us remind you that a ticket is lucky if the sum of digits in its first half matches the sum of digits in its second half."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"But of course, not every ticket can be lucky. Far from it! Moreover, sometimes one look at a ticket can be enough to say right away that the ticket is not lucky. So, let's consider the following "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"unluckiness criterion"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" that can definitely determine an unlucky ticket. We'll say that a ticket is definitely unlucky if each digit from the first half corresponds to some digit from the second half so that each digit from the first half is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"strictly less"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" than the corresponding digit from the second one or each digit from the first half is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"strictly more"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" than the corresponding digit from the second one. Each digit should be used exactly once in the comparisons. In other words, there is such "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bijective correspondence"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" between the digits of the first and the second half of the ticket, that either each digit of the first half turns out "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"strictly less"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" than the corresponding digit of the second half or each digit of the first half turns out "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"strictly more"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" than the corresponding digit from the second half."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, ticket "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2421"},{"kind":"text","text":" meets the following unluckiness criterion and will not be considered lucky (the sought correspondence is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 > 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4 > 2"},{"kind":"text","text":"), ticket "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0135"},{"kind":"text","text":" also meets the criterion (the sought correspondence is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 < 3"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 < 5"},{"kind":"text","text":"), and ticket "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3754"},{"kind":"text","text":" does not meet the criterion. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have a ticket in your hands, it contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2n"},{"kind":"text","text":" digits. Your task is to check whether it meets the unluckiness criterion."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The second line contains a string that consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2n"},{"kind":"text","text":" digits and defines your ticket."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the ticket meets the unluckiness criterion. Otherwise, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n2421\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"YES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n0135\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"YES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n3754\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"NO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"160B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/160/problem/B"}